      "role": "user",
      "content": "i messed up something huge at work. it wasn't just a mistake, it actually hurt people. real people. i can't stop thinking about how much of a monster i am for letting it happen. i feel like i've fundamentally broken something in the world and there's no way to fix it. i just feel so heavy and wrong. like i don't even belong here anymore.",
